Package: DegradSim
Title: Simulation of Lévy and Time-Scaled Lévy Degradation Processes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Amedée Rytrace", "Tito", , "rytracetito5@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Christian", "Paroissin", , "christian.paroissin@univ-pau.fr", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Exact simulation, at given inspection times, of one or several
    degradation trajectories of Lévy processes (gamma, Wiener, inverse
    Gaussian, variance-gamma, Meixner, normal inverse Gaussian and compound
    Poisson processes) and of time-scaled Lévy processes X_t = Y_{A(t)},
    obtained with a time-scaling function A from a gamma, Wiener or inverse
    Gaussian process (Kahle, Mercier and Paroissin, 2016,
    ISBN:978-1-84821-888-8; Cha and Mercier, 2019,
    <doi:10.1017/apr.2019.21>); inspection times with a chosen pattern,
    plotting of the trajectories and extraction of the simulated data.
License: GPL-3
